  [ ] #96 Domain: @RideOutline, @OutlineHit, @HeatPoints (EXACT).
  [ ] #96 Overview map widget in `/lib/map` with lines, heat and position layers.
  [ ] #96 History switch, legend, preview card pager, preferences.
  [ ] #96 `CHANGELOG.md` and l10n (de, en); no privacy-policy change, there is no new data flow.

Done when:
  `flutter analyze` is clean, `flutter test` passes and `specdd lint` passes.
  The overview with many rides, the position button and the tap pager are checked on an Android and an iOS device.
